{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/eccbccb6cd100a62bf8dabb254acf111.poster.avif?t=1773753420\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/eccbccb6cd100a62bf8dabb254acf111.webm?t=1773753420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/eccbccb6cd100a62bf8dabb254acf111.mp4?t=1773753420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>About</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrolite is a fast-paced survival roguelite. Fight across the solar system annihilating the world guardians protecting the galaxy in a conquest to eliminate all in your way. Upgrade unique weapons and develop your own gameplay combinations to aid in defeating a relentless onslaught of asteroids out to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/034f617f56db1db431912e85e0c33641.poster.avif?t=1773753420\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/034f617f56db1db431912e85e0c33641.webm?t=1773753420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/034f617f56db1db431912e85e0c33641.mp4?t=1773753420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Auto-firing weapons with manual aiming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fast runs (~30 minutes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Level Up, and improve a wide array of powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Over 15 unique weapons to choose from</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Upgrade weapons and passives an unlimited amount of times</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unlock multiple new characters with vastly different playstyles through achievements in-game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fight against over 25 unique enemies all tied to respective their planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Defend against an onslaught in a bullet heaven style on each planet before facing the World Guardian</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Go on the offensive and destroy the Guardians protecting the planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/c5552af9a231eecc33fec37d29c5e755.poster.avif?t=1773753420\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/c5552af9a231eecc33fec37d29c5e755.webm?t=1773753420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/c5552af9a231eecc33fec37d29c5e755.mp4?t=1773753420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450850?t=1773753420","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/c70e80453bafd9cdfaf9525e82f9ed99c3bd568f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773753420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/1d0b2d9c61ebddaca984951bd929099462a80080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773753420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/1d0b2d9c61ebddaca984951bd929099462a80080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773753420","categor